<header class="ws-head"><p class="ws-kicker">Worksheet &middot; Cultures</p><h1 class="ws-title">Worksheet: Cultures of the Americas</h1><p class="ws-lede">A worksheet on 16 cultures of the Americas, from the Clovis culture to the Lakota people. Read their profiles, then answer.</p><p class="ws-who" aria-hidden="true"><span>Name</span><span>Class</span><span>Date</span></p><p class="ws-tools"><button type="button" class="ws-print" data-key="0">Print the worksheet</button><button type="button" class="ws-print" data-key="1">Print with the answers</button><a href="/profiles?kind=culture&amp;region=Americas">Open the cultures &rarr;</a></p></header>
<section class="ws-task"><h2><span class="ws-n">1</span>Put the cultures in order</h2><p class="ws-how">Number the cultures from 1 (the earliest to begin) to 7 (the latest).</p><ul class="ws-order"><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Paracas culture</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Mapuche</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Caral–Supe civilisation</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Ancestral Puebloans</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Olmecs</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Maya civilisation</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Clovis culture</span></li></ul></section>
